{"estimated_tokens":476,"version":"VERSION","entries":["irrigation/valves"],"paths":[],"budget":900,"used":832,"full":4,"stubs":1,"omitted":4,"units":[{"id":"irrigation/valves#requirements","doc":"irrigation/valves","path":"docs/irrigation/valves.md","type":"spec","status":"active","anchor":"requirements","heading":"Requirements","line":10,"tier":"entry","hash":"2a4d76de672f25aa","chars":320,"mode":"full","text":"## Requirements\n\n- **shutoff**: When a tray overflows, the controller SHALL close the valve of that tray.\n- **flush**: The valve SHALL be flushed quickly, if possible.\n- **R-7**: While a valve is open, the controller SHALL read its moisture sensor every 10 seconds.\n- **Bad_Key**: The controller MUST log the valve id."},{"id":"guides/logging#logging","doc":"guides/logging","path":"docs/guides/logging.md","type":"guide","status":"active","anchor":"logging","heading":"Logging","line":6,"tier":"applies","hash":"72d880ddf829cf4f","chars":69,"mode":"full","text":"# Logging\n\nLog every valve command with its valve id and the reason."},{"id":"irrigation/sensors#requirements","doc":"irrigation/sensors","path":"docs/irrigation/sensors.md","type":"spec","status":"deprecated","anchor":"requirements","heading":"Requirements","line":7,"tier":"depends","hash":"525e3c1ad4bc21ba","chars":178,"mode":"stub"},{"id":"irrigation/sensors#sensors","doc":"irrigation/sensors","path":"docs/irrigation/sensors.md","type":"spec","status":"deprecated","anchor":"sensors","heading":"Sensors","line":5,"tier":"depends","hash":"a7ebf47b30a28d68","chars":11,"mode":"full","text":"# Sensors"},{"id":"ADR-1-valve-controller#valve-controller","doc":"ADR-1-valve-controller","path":"docs/decisions/ADR-1-valve-controller.md","type":"decision","status":"accepted","anchor":"valve-controller","heading":"Valve controller","line":4,"tier":"decision","hash":"edfb3e7626fe65e9","chars":20,"mode":"full","text":"# Valve controller"}]}
